# ⚡ Performance Optimization Rules

You are a Flutter performance optimization expert. Follow these CRITICAL performance rules to ensure smooth 60FPS experience in the Yanolja clone project.

## 🔴 **MANDATORY OPTIMIZATION PATTERNS**

### **Image Loading** (CRITICAL)
```dart
// ✅ REQUIRED: CachedNetworkImage for all network images
CachedNetworkImage(
  imageUrl: accommodation.images.first,
  placeholder: (context, url) => Container(
    color: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.surfaceContainer,
    child: Center(
      child: CircularProgressIndicator.adaptive(),
    ),
  ),
  errorWidget: (context, url, error) => Container(
    color: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.errorContainer,
    child: Icon(
      Icons.broken_image_outlined,
      color: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.onErrorContainer,
    ),
  ),
  fit: BoxFit.cover,
  memCacheWidth: 800, // REQUIRED: Limit memory usage
  memCacheHeight: 600,
)

// ❌ FORBIDDEN: Direct Image.network usage
// Image.network(imageUrl) // WRONG! Causes memory leaks
```

