## 🎯 **STATE MANAGEMENT PERFORMANCE**

### **Provider Optimization Patterns**
```dart
// ✅ REQUIRED: keepAlive for expensive computations
final expensiveDataProvider = FutureProvider<ExpensiveData>((ref) async {
  ref.keepAlive(); // REQUIRED: Prevent disposal
  
  final repository = ref.watch(repositoryProvider);
  return await repository.computeExpensiveData();
});

// ✅ REQUIRED: Debouncing for search inputs
final debouncedSearchProvider = Provider<String>((ref) {
  final searchQuery = ref.watch(searchQueryProvider);
  
  // REQUIRED: Return empty for short queries
  if (searchQuery.length < 2) return '';
  
  return searchQuery;
});

// ✅ REQUIRED: Pagination for large datasets
final paginatedAccommodationsProvider = FutureProvider.family<List<Accommodation>, int>(
  (ref, page) async {
    final repository = ref.watch(accommodationRepositoryProvider);
    return await repository.getAccommodationsPaginated(page: page, limit: 20);
  },
);
```

