## 🚨 **PERFORMANCE VIOLATIONS**

**IMMEDIATELY FIX:**
- Image.network without caching
- Missing dispose() methods for controllers
- Heavy computation in build methods
- Column with 20+ children (use ListView.builder)
- Function creation in build methods
- Missing const constructors
- No keys in dynamic lists
- Unnecessary setState calls
- Riverpod provider without proper scope

